{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling.md","title":"互模拟刻画展开相等","display":"thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling — 互模拟刻画展开相等","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling","aliases":["56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling"],"display":"thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling — 互模拟刻画展开相等","depends_on":["[[56-df-term-graph]]","[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]","[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]","[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Proposition 13.2.13","source_printed_pages":"718","source_ocr_blocks":[739],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-term-graph-bisimulation-unravelling — 互模拟刻画展开相等"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c088d04d4303598\" href=\"?note=1c088d04d4303598\" title=\"56-df-graph-unravelling\">56-df-graph-unravelling</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a89c52b489c33b7\" href=\"?note=9a89c52b489c33b7\" title=\"56-df-graph-bisimulation\">56-df-graph-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Proposition 13.2.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"718"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>739</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\">\\(H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a> 的同签名项图条件。</li>\n<li>访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1c088d04d4303598\" href=\"?note=1c088d04d4303598\" title=\"56-df-graph-unravelling\">56-df-graph-unravelling</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9a89c52b489c33b7\" href=\"?note=9a89c52b489c33b7\" title=\"56-df-graph-bisimulation\">56-df-graph-bisimulation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4a9c89b3e42d1880\" href=\"?note=4a9c89b3e42d1880\" title=\"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism\">56-df-term-graph-homomorphism</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\">\\(B\\subseteq N_G\\times N_H\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,H)\n\\iff\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)=\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GraphBisimilar}_\\Sigma(G,H)\n\\iff\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)=\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)=\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H)\n\\iff\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)=\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H)\n\\iff\\operatorname{GraphIso}_\\Sigma(\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G),\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(H)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{Acc}_G=\\operatorname{Acc}_H\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\;\n(\\operatorname{end}_G(p),\\operatorname{end}_H(p))\\in B\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GraphBisim}_\\Sigma(G,H,B)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{Acc}_G=\\operatorname{Acc}_H\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\;\n(\\operatorname{end}_G(p),\\operatorname{end}_H(p))\\in B\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对原书命题与其经树互模拟推出同构的证明。本笔记对路径编码另作直接推导：由根对起，按访问路径长度归纳，互模拟使双方拥有相同合法访问路径且相应终点处于关系中；标签部分相等和出度一致使两个展开四元组逐分量相等。反向令关系由所有相同访问路径的终点对组成；空路径提供根对，延长路径提供逐参数保持，展开标签相等提供Kleene标签条件。</p>\n<p>展开树之间任何根保持的参数保持同态必须把每条路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 映到它自身，由路径长度归纳可证；若同态双射，则双方访问路径集合、标签和参数都相同，给第二个等价式。原书用同构类相等，本笔记在规范路径载体上可用字面相等。一般原图即使互模拟，也可以有不同共享、循环或不可达部分；该定理没有断言原图同构。</p>\n<p>此处为人工核对的证明，未给出机器化一般证明；开放节点情形已明确处理，并非仅闭项图片段。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-unravelling","status":"resolved","id":"1c088d04d4303598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"9a89c52b489c33b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"4a9c89b3e42d1880","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$、$H=(N_H,a_H,\\lambda_H,r_H)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的同签名项图条件。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-unravelling","status":"resolved","id":"1c088d04d4303598","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。","embed":false},{"target":